# oracle: fix neighbor/swap diff with the region, rates and ke keywords in a displaced two-type fcc box with unequal masses (the accepted swaps rescale the velocities by sqrt(mass ratio)); 12 MD steps, MC every 3 steps with 4 cycles
# Measured (ORACLE_MEASURE=1): thermo 2.0e-15, atoms 2.9e-14; counters equal at every row; engine ~0.2-1 s warm. native: lmp b332f28, sort off.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
atom_modify     map array sort 0 0.0
lattice         fcc 0.9
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
mass            2 2.0
variable        dx atom 0.08*sin(1.3*x+0.7*y)
variable        dy atom 0.08*cos(0.9*y)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy 0.0 units box
region          half block INF 2.5 INF INF INF INF units box
set             region half type 2
region          right block 1.0 INF INF INF INF INF units box
pair_style      lj/cut 1.4
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0
neighbor        0.3 bin
timestep        0.005
velocity        all create 1.0 4928 loop geom
fix             1 all nve
compute         v all voronoi/atom neighbors yes
fix             mc all neighbor/swap 3 4 777 1.0 1.2 v diff 2 region right rates 1.0 0.7 ke yes
thermo_style    custom step pe ke f_mc[1] f_mc[2]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          4
run             12
